      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, the Flutter Canary is failing to `gn gen` with\n\n```\nGenerating GN files in: out/host_debug_unopt\nERROR at //third_party/skia/BUILD.gn:45:7: Undefined identifier\n  if (skia_enable_optimize_size) {\n      ^------------------------\nSee //flutter/shell/testing/BUILD.gn:36:5: which caused the file to be included.\n    \"//third_party/skia\",\n    ^-------------------\n```\n\nbecause the Flutter build isn\u0027t using our `BUILDCONFIG.gn` but is using their own which does not declare `skia_enable_optimize_size` as an arg so it isn\u0027t there in our `BUILD.gn` (which Flutter does use).",
